ARCHITECTURE (ADR-002/004/005/006/013/014/015)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - InboxPage (SwiftUI View) + @Observable InboxPageModel. No business logic in the
    view body; the page owns the three web i18n keys, the copy-link share URL, the
    "View archived" target route, and the embedded InboxBodyModel (archived: false).
  - Data seams keep the web hook names at the Swift call sites: InboxPageModel.vehicles
    (useVehicles → GET /vehicles) and InboxPageModel.rules (useAlertRules →
    GET /alerts/rules) surface the inbox's resolved directory/rule context, exactly
    as the web page passes vehicles + rules into <InboxBody/>. They reach the inbox
    through its InboxSource snapshot (P1/S8); production injects the shared KMP
    notification bindings, previews/tests inject InMemoryInboxSource. Only the
    seam changes when the generated client lands (P1/S2-S3) — the view never
    touches the network (ADR-004).
  - Region reproduced (the web page's single body region): the shared InboxBody
    feature view, fixed to the active tab. It renders loading (skeleton) / error
    (+Retry) / empty (ContentUnavailableView) / content itself, with the active
    bulk-action set (Mark read · Archive · Delete) and the >2-min staleness chrome
    (ADR-013) — never a blank region.
  - Header chrome (web PageContainer): TSPageTitle(title) + subtitle Text +
    "View archived" TSButton (ghost/small, SF Symbol archivebox, web lucide Archive)
    navigating to .notificationsArchived (web /notifications/archived) + CopyLinkButton
    (web copyLink window.location.href → /notifications/inbox).
  - Tokens only (P2 — apps/design/generated/apple/Tokens.swift): TSSpacing, Color.TS,
    Font.TS — no hardcoded colors/typography. Materials/glass via InboxBody's
    TSGlassPanel (ADR-005). Adaptive macOS (regular) + iOS (compact/regular):
    centered max-width column + ScrollView, .task{load}/.refreshable{refresh}.
  - i18n: every literal via LocalizedStringKey with the web key names (ADR-014);
    +3 catalog entries (English fallbacks = web defaults). a11y: header is an
    a11y container; the archive action has an explicit accessibilityLabel; InboxBody
    carries the surface a11y label, VoiceOver, Dynamic Type, light/dark/contrast
    (ADR-015). Units: N/A at this page boundary (no physical quantities rendered by
    the page chrome); the inbox formats any values via the shared SI converters (P1/S5).
  - Navigation: InboxRouteRegistration registers .notifications (the native inbox
    host; web /notifications redirects to /notifications/inbox). AppRouteParser
    already aliases "/notifications/inbox" -> .notifications (deep-linkable), and the
    sibling ArchivedPage's "Back to inbox" (-> .notifications) now lands on this page.
    Wired in TeslaSyncApp.swift after ArchivedRouteRegistration with
    onNavigate: { selection = $0 }.

